{"id":"tempora-pent01-4.postcommunion","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Tempora/Pent01-4.txt","section":"Postcommunio"}],"t":{"la":["Postcommunio"],"fr":["Postcommunion"]}}
{"id":"tempora-pent01-4.postcommunion.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Fac nos, quǽsumus, Dómine, divinitátis tuæ sempitérna fruitióne repléri: quam pretiósi Corporis et Sanguinis tui temporalis percéptio præfigúrat: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre, in unitáte Spíritus Sancti, Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
